WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
F1 shows the shortcut sheet: the keys of every window, FL Studio's own.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.400
Every shortcut can be changed: Manage shortcuts.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.200
Search an action or a key, here the metronome.

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:26.400
Select it, click Change and press the new keys.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.400
Changed only lists your changes; Reset to default puts one back.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:38.200
The typing keyboard: Ctrl+T switches it, and your letter keys play notes.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:45.000
Z to M is one octave, Q to I the next: the selected instrument plays them.
